  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HOM&apos;S FUND 2024- AL FARTHAKH SPORT CENTER MA&apos;AN FOR FEMALE CENTRE IN MA&apos;AN GOV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to establish and equip a dedicated fitness center for women within Al-Fardakh Sports Club. The initiative addresses a significant need for such a facility, as the existing center primarily caters to men, and cultural customs and traditions in the community often prevent women from accessing its services. By creating a women-only fitness center, the project seeks to foster a sense of belonging and empowerment for women within the community</narrative>
  </description>
